title: SAP MaxDB: Data Backup
agents: linux, windows
catalog: app/maxdb
license: GPL
distribution: check_mk
description:
 Monitors the age, duration and most recent attempt of the data backup.
 Uses the maxdb_backup_extended agent section and its own MaxDB Data Backup ruleset.
 For correct results, the agent must provide a sufficiently complete backup history.
item:
 Database name
discovery:
 One service per database when the extended backup section is present.
